      "excerpt": "         I2.17.5 If the structure is evaluated based on linear calculation methods, the following are to\n         be considered:\n\n         (1)     Web plates and flange elements in compression and shear to fulfil relevant buckling\n                 criteria as specified by the Classification Society\n\n         (2)     Nominal shear stresses in member web plates to be less than y /3\n\n         (3)     Nominal von Mises stresses in member flanges to be less than 1.15 y\n\n\n",
      "review_note": "Classification-society buckling criteria plus strict shear sigma/sqrt(3) and flange von-Mises 1.15*sigma thresholds.",
      "frozen_text": "For linear calculation methods: web plates and flange elements in compression and shear are to fulfil the relevant buckling criteria specified by the Classification Society; nominal shear stress in member web plates is to be less than sigma_y/sqrt(3); and nominal von Mises stress in member flanges is to be less than 1.15*sigma_y."
    },
